      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Checks + resulting-head review are required\nreview-findings verifies reported claims and scope. Verified in-scope P0–P3 findings return to the coder;\nrerun affected checks. False positives are rejected; out-of-scope findings are recorded, not corrected.\nEscalate the same unresolved issue after two unsuccessful rounds.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Checks + resulting-head review are required\nreview-findings verifies reported claims and scope. Verified in-scope P0–P3 findings return to the coder;\nrerun affected checks. False positives are rejected; out-of-scope findings are recorded, not corrected.\nEscalate the same unresolved issue after two unsuccessful rounds.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
