      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Source gaps shown, not inferred\n• Workflow requires resulting-head review but names no reviewer dispatch.\n• Independent proposal / planning critic has no named Codex role.\n• No /workflow wrapper; complete workflow is an explicit skill.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Source gaps shown, not inferred\n• Workflow requires resulting-head review but names no reviewer dispatch.\n• Independent proposal / planning critic has no named Codex role.\n• No /workflow wrapper; complete workflow is an explicit skill.",
